{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"余滤范畴"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"余滤范畴"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>以余滤范畴为指标的极限是一类重要的极限, 称为"},{"Local":{"url":"余滤极限","text":"余滤极限"}},{"Plain":", 与 "},{"Local":{"url":"pro-对象","text":null}},{"Plain":"有关.</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>余滤范畴是"},{"Local":{"url":"滤范畴","text":"滤范畴"}},{"Plain":"的对偶.</p>\n"}]}}